        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Introduction</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The intended playtime is approximately 20-30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While there are minimal puzzle elements, they are primarily part of the game's narrative devices and atmospheric effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily designed to be an experience-driven narrative game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Overview</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is a psychological suspense/puzzle adventure game where a player-controlled protagonist, suffering from memory loss, navigates a computer file management system to uncover fragments of their past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will explore files and folders while gradually uncovering the hidden truth through the unfolding story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Game Streaming Guidelines</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to stream the game! Though we'd be grateful if you could promote the store link during your stream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
